        "last_commit_message": "Spawn harness CLIs in their own process group under uvloop (#1343)\n\nThe Codex app-server and Grok ACP spawns passed process_group=0 so close\ncould reap the CLI's whole tree. Core runs on uvloop, which rejects that\nkeyword (\"unexpected kwargs: process_group\") before the child starts, so\nevery Codex harness start failed. Keep process_group=0 on the stdlib loop\nand use preexec_fn=os.setpgrp on uvloop: the child still gets its own\ngroup inside the worker's session.\n\nCo-authored-by: berylliumsec-handler <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
